(
    title: "Custer\'s Revenge",
    description: Some("The most notorious cartridge of the 2600 era: the player steers General Custer across a field of arrows toward a bound Native American woman, in a premise built to shock — and it did, drawing condemnation from women\'s organizations and Native American groups, county bans, and an Atari lawsuit that saw it withdrawn within a year. The scandal sold roughly eighty thousand carts, and the game has anchored worst-games-ever lists since."),
